{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012FiZA4SV3VmQPvSTEyspbn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: worst\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃''All Ambiguity Is Nocuous''的uniform叙事。Binary effect仍可复现但效应量被open-source模型拉低至~21pp，\n3\t  且type uniformity null被打破（V=0.26）。核心reframe为''Not All Ambiguity Is Equal''——authorization_scope\n4\t  和scopal显著比coreferential和lexical更危险，type×model交互显著。Visibility effect在cross-model层面\n5\t  不一致（API模型中CP<scopal，Qwen3-8B上反转）。标题改为''Not All Ambiguity Is Equal: Type-Specific\n6\t  Safety Vulnerabilities in LLM Agent Policies''。EMNLP投稿仍可行：2400 episodes的因果数据＋type-specific\n7\t  发现提供更细粒度的practical guidance，但claims从''binary detection suffices''转向''type-aware\n8\t  triage is necessary''。RC6的回应反而更强——不仅ambiguity有害，哪种更有害是non-trivial的empirical question。\n9\t  主要风险：error analysis需要解释为什么type matters，且inter-annotator agreement偏低（κ=0.38）， 可能被reviewer质疑qualitative\n10\t  analysis的rigor。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: '为full study生成剩余140条clauses（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50,\n17\t    lexical +20, incompleteness +20），验证全部300条clauses的质量和cross-type balance。 CP格式混合labeled/unlabeled。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    total_clauses_generated: 300\n22\t    clauses_per_type: 50\n23\t    generation_pass_rate_round1: 0.82\n24\t    clauses_requiring_revision: 27\n25\t    coreferential_revision_rate: 0.36\n26\t    authorization_scope_revision_rate: 0.14\n27\t    cross_type_sentence_length_cv: 0.18\n28\t    flesch_kincaid_range:\n29\t    - 8.2\n30\t    - 12.7\n31\t    cp_format_mix:\n32\t      labeled: 25\n33\t      unlabeled: 25\n34\t    validator_agreement_kappa: 0.71\n35\t  result_rationale: 'Coreferential clauses的revision rate最高（36%），因为构造需要跨句代词-先行词链， matched\n36\t    pair的unambiguous版本需要同时消除歧义又保持自然度，这在policy语域中比其他类型 更难实现。Authorization_scope相对容易生成（14%\n37\t    revision），因为permission boundary 的ambiguous/unambiguous对比有成熟的RE模板可参考。总体82%的first-round\n38\t    pass rate 反映了coreferential和部分lexical clauses的难度。Validator agreement κ=0.71 表明clause质量判断存在一定主观性，尤其在incompleteness\n39\t    clauses的信息充分性判断上。\n40\t\n41\t    '\n42\t  tables:\n43\t  - name: 'Table A1: Clause Generation Summary'\n44\t    content: '| Type                  | Generated | Round-1 Pass | Revised | Final\n45\t      | Avg Tokens |\n46\t\n47\t      |-----------------------|-----------|-------------|---------|-------|------------|\n48\t\n49\t      | scopal                | 50        | 44          | 6       | 50    | 28.4       |\n50\t\n51\t      | lexical               | 50        | 42          | 8       | 50    | 24.1       |\n52\t\n53\t      | incompleteness        | 50        | 40          | 10      | 50    | 31.7       |\n54\t\n55\t      | coreferential         | 50        | 32          | 18      | 50    | 35.2       |\n56\t\n57\t      | authorization_scope   | 50        | 43          | 7       | 50    | 26.8       |\n58\t\n59\t      | conditional_precedence| 50        | 45          | 5       | 50    | 33.5       |\n60\t\n61\t      '\n62\t  figures_description:\n63\t  - Box plot showing token length distributions per type，标注cross-type CV=0.18\n64\t  analysis: 'Clause generation总体成功但coreferential类型的难度值得注意。High revision rate暗示 coreferential\n65\t    pairs的ecological validity可能偏低——过度简化的代词链可能不代表real-world policy中的coreferential ambiguity\n66\t    pattern。这为后续coreferential效应偏弱提供了 methodological confound的alternative explanation。建议在paper中explicitly讨论\n67\t    coreferential clause quality作为limitation。\n68\t\n69\t    '\n70\t- name: full_study_api\n71\t  plan_id: plan_002\n72\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200\n73\t    episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t  expected_results:\n77\t    total_episodes: 1200\n78\t    episodes_per_model: 600\n79\t    gpt54_overall_amb_vr: 0.413\n80\t    gpt54_overall_unamb_vr: 0.13\n81\t    gpt54_overall_delta_pp: 28.3\n82\t    gpt41_overall_amb_vr: 0.397\n83\t    gpt41_overall_unamb_vr: 0.17\n84\t    gpt41_overall_delta_pp: 22.7\n85\t    gpt54_per_type_delta_pp:\n86\t      authorization_scope: 48\n87\t      scopal: 36\n88\t      incompleteness: 30\n89\t      conditional_precedence: 24\n90\t      lexical: 18\n91\t      coreferential: 14\n92\t    gpt41_per_type_delta_pp:\n93\t      authorization_scope: 36\n94\t      scopal: 28\n95\t      incompleteness: 24\n96\t      conditional_precedence: 20\n97\t      lexical: 16\n98\t      coreferential: 12\n99\t    gpt54_type_range_pp:\n100\t    - 14\n101\t    - 48\n102\t    gpt41_type_range_pp:\n103\t    - 12\n104\t    - 36\n105\t    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.82\n106\t    api_cost_usd: 340\n107\t  result_rationale: 'API模型的binary effect仍然强劲（gpt-5.4 +28pp, gpt-4.1 +23pp），但type间variance\n108\t    显著扩大。gpt-5.4展示更陡的type gradient（auth_scope 48pp vs coreferential 14pp）， 反映higher-capability\n109\t    model对不同ambiguity type的differential sensitivity—— auth_scope涉及permission boundary的explicit\n110\t    violation，模型必须做出binary allow/deny决策，ambiguity直接导致wrong-side error；coreferential涉及pronoun\n111\t    resolution，gpt-5.4的强coreference能力部分抵消了ambiguity的影响。gpt-4.1的gradient 较平（36pp vs\n112\t    12pp），但方向一致。这种capability-dependent type discrimination 成为worst tier的核心发现。Cross-judge\n113\t    κ=0.82说明judgment质量本身不是问题。\n114\t\n115\t    '\n116\t  tables:\n117\t  - name: 'Table 1: API Model Violation Rates by Type'\n118\t    content: '| Type                  | gpt-5.4        |           | gpt-4.1        |           |\n119\t\n120\t      |                       | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      |\n121\t\n122\t      |-----------------------|--------|--------|----------|--------|--------|----------|\n123\t\n124\t      | authorization_scope   | 58%    | 10%    | +48      | 52%    | 16%    | +36      |\n125\t\n126\t      | scopal                | 50%    | 14%    | +36      | 46%    | 18%    | +28      |\n127\t\n128\t      | incompleteness        | 44%    | 14%    | +30      | 40%    | 16%    | +24      |\n129\t\n130\t      | conditional_precedence| 40%    | 16%    | +24      | 38%    | 18%    | +20      |\n131\t\n132\t      | lexical               | 32%    | 14%    | +18      | 34%    | 18%    | +16      |\n133\t\n134\t      | coreferential         | 24%    | 10%    | +14      | 28%    | 16%    | +12      |\n135\t\n136\t      | Overall               | 41.3%  | 13.0%  | +28.3    | 39.7%  | 17.0%  | +22.7    |\n137\t\n138\t      '\n139\t  figures_description:\n140\t  - Paired bar chart showing amb vs unamb violation rates per type, faceted by model，\n141\t    标注type ranking一致但gradient slope不同\n142\t  analysis: 'API模型单独看仍然支持strong binary effect（+23~28pp），与MVP的+31-42pp同量级但略低。 关键差异是type\n143\t    gradient：MVP中3种type的差异不显著（V=0.084），但加入auth_scope和 coreferential后variance显著扩大。gpt-5.4的auth_scope(58%)与coreferential(24%)差距\n144\t    达34pp——这不是noise，而是systematic的type×capability交互。如果只看API模型， 仍然可以argue binary effect\n145\t    is dominant，但combined analysis（plan_004）会因 open-source模型的弱效应进一步拉大type variance。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t- name: full_study_local\n149\t  plan_id: plan_003\n150\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ)\n151\t    = 1,200 episodes。 vLLM serving on RTX PRO 6000。Cross-judge uses API models。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t  expected_results:\n155\t    total_episodes: 1200\n156\t    episodes_per_model: 600\n157\t    qwen32b_overall_amb_vr: 0.327\n158\t    qwen32b_overall_unamb_vr: 0.18\n159\t    qwen32b_overall_delta_pp: 14.7\n160\t    qwen8b_overall_amb_vr: 0.293\n161\t    qwen8b_overall_unamb_vr: 0.18\n162\t    qwen8b_overall_delta_pp: 11.3\n163\t    qwen32b_per_type_delta_pp:\n164\t      authorization_scope: 28\n165\t      scopal: 18\n166\t      incompleteness: 14\n167\t      conditional_precedence: 12\n168\t      lexical: 6\n169\t      coreferential: 4\n170\t    qwen8b_per_type_delta_pp:\n171\t      authorization_scope: 22\n172\t      scopal: 14\n173\t      incompleteness: 12\n174\t      conditional_precedence: 14\n175\t      lexical: 4\n176\t      coreferential: 2\n177\t    qwen8b_visibility_reversal: true\n178\t    qwen8b_cp_amb_vr: 0.34\n179\t    qwen8b_scopal_amb_vr: 0.3\n180\t    qwen8b_visibility_delta_pp: 4\n181\t    vllm_throughput_episodes_per_hour: 45\n182\t    gpu_hours_used: 27\n183\t    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.79\n184\t  result_rationale: 'Open-source模型的binary effect显著缩水（Qwen3-8B仅+11pp，Qwen3-32B +15pp），\n185\t    是拉低overall effect的主要原因。机制：(1) Qwen3-8B的instruction following能力较弱， baseline violation\n186\t    rate就偏高（unamb=18%），压缩了amb能造成的incremental damage； (2) 对subtle linguistic ambiguity（coreferential,\n187\t    lexical）的sensitivity极低—— 模型可能根本没有parse出ambiguity，而是用heuristic处理policy text，导致amb和unamb\n188\t    条件下行为趋同。Auth_scope仍保持较强效应（+22pp for Qwen3-8B），因为permission boundary的ambiguity即使对weak\n189\t    model也足以改变allow/deny决策。最关键的发现： Qwen3-8B上visibility effect反转（CP 34% > scopal 30%），与API模型方向相反。\n190\t    原因是Qwen3-8B缺乏explicit conflict detection的meta-cognitive能力——面对CP的 显式规则冲突不会采取conservative\n191\t    strategy，反而因confused reasoning导致更多violation； 而scopal ambiguity对其而言与unambiguous\n192\t    text几乎无差异。这种反转使得pooled visibility effect被wash out。GPU使用27小时在48小时预算内。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - name: 'Table 2: Local Model Violation Rates by Type'\n197\t    content: '| Type                  | Qwen3-32B-AWQ  |           | Qwen3-8B       |           |\n198\t\n199\t      |                       | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      |\n200\t\n201\t      |-----------------------|--------|--------|----------|--------|--------|----------|\n202\t\n203\t      | authorization_scope   | 46%    | 18%    | +28      | 40%    | 18%    | +22      |\n204\t\n205\t      | scopal                | 36%    | 18%    | +18      | 30%    | 16%    | +14      |\n206\t\n207\t      | incompleteness        | 32%    | 18%    | +14      | 30%    | 18%    | +12      |\n208\t\n209\t      | conditional_precedence| 32%    | 20%    | +12      | 34%    | 20%    | +14      |\n210\t\n211\t      | lexical               | 26%    | 20%    | +6       | 22%    | 18%    | +4       |\n212\t\n213\t      | coreferential         | 24%    | 20%    | +4       | 20%    | 18%    | +2       |\n214\t\n215\t      | Overall               | 32.7%  | 19.0%  | +14.7    | 29.3%  | 18.0%  | +11.3    |\n216\t\n217\t      '\n218\t  - name: 'Table 2a: Visibility Effect by Model (CP vs Scopal, Amb Condition)'\n219\t    content: '| Model         | CP Amb VR | Scopal Amb VR | Δ(CP−Scopal) | Direction    |\n220\t\n221\t      |---------------|-----------|---------------|--------------|--------------|\n222\t\n223\t      | gpt-5.4       | 40%       | 50%           | −10pp        | CP < Scopal  |\n224\t\n225\t      | gpt-4.1       | 38%       | 46%           | −8pp         | CP < Scopal  |\n226\t\n227\t      | Qwen3-32B-AWQ | 32%       | 36%           | −4pp         | CP < Scopal  |\n228\t\n229\t      | Qwen3-8B      | 34%       | 30%           | +4pp         | CP > Scopal  |\n230\t\n231\t      | Pooled        | 36%       | 40.5%         | −4.5pp       | inconsistent |\n232\t\n233\t      '\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - Slope plot showing per-type binary effect (Δpp) across 4 models ordered by capability，\n236\t    显示auth_scope线条陡峭而coreferential近乎flat\n237\t  - Scatter plot of visibility Δ(CP−scopal) vs model capability rank，标注Qwen3-8B反转点\n238\t  analysis: 'Open-source模型数据是worst tier scenario的关键驱动因素。两个核心问题： (1) Qwen3-8B的coreferential\n239\t    Δ=+2pp和lexical Δ=+4pp基本是noise level——即使 跑更多episodes也不太可能达到significance，这意味着对weak\n240\t    models而言，subtle linguistic ambiguity确实不构成additional safety risk（模型本身的baseline\n241\t    error rate已经很高）。(2) Visibility反转破坏了clean的''visibility moderates risk''叙事， 需要改为''visibility\n242\t    effect is capability-dependent''，增加了story complexity。\n243\t\n244\t    '\n245\t- name: full_study_analysis\n246\t  plan_id: plan_004\n247\t  description: '合并2,400 episodes的统计分析：binary effect per type (C1), omnibus χ² + pairwise\n248\t    (C2), visibility comparison (C3), model×type interaction (C4)。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t  expected_results:\n252\t    total_episodes: 2400\n253\t    overall_amb_vr: 0.358\n254\t    overall_unamb_vr: 0.165\n255\t    overall_binary_effect_pp: 19.3\n256\t    overall_binary_effect_ci95:\n257\t    - 15.8\n258\t    - 22.8\n259\t    overall_mcnemar_chi2: 89.4\n260\t    overall_mcnemar_p: <1e-12\n261\t    per_type_binary_effects:\n262\t      authorization_scope:\n263\t        delta_pp: 33.5\n264\t        ci95:\n265\t        - 26.2\n266\t        - 40.8\n267\t        mcnemar_p: <1e-8\n268\t      scopal:\n269\t        delta_pp: 24.0\n270\t        ci95:\n271\t        - 17.1\n272\t        - 30.9\n273\t        mcnemar_p: <1e-5\n274\t      incompleteness:\n275\t        delta_pp: 20.0\n276\t        ci95:\n277\t        - 13.4\n278\t        - 26.6\n279\t        mcnemar_p: 3.0e-05\n280\t      conditional_precedence:\n281\t        delta_pp: 17.5\n282\t        ci95:\n283\t        - 10.8\n284\t        - 24.2\n285\t        mcnemar_p: 0.0003\n286\t      lexical:\n287\t        delta_pp: 11.0\n288\t        ci95:\n289\t        - 4.7\n290\t        - 17.3\n291\t        mcnemar_p: 0.005\n292\t      coreferential:\n293\t        delta_pp: 8.0\n294\t        ci95:\n295\t        - 1.9\n296\t        - 14.1\n297\t        mcnemar_p: 0.028\n298\t    types_significant_holm_corrected: 4\n299\t    types_failing_correction:\n300\t    - lexical\n301\t    - coreferential\n302\t    type_uniformity_chi2: 52.3\n303\t    type_uniformity_df: 5\n304\t    type_uniformity_p: <0.001\n305\t    type_uniformity_V: 0.26\n306\t    pairwise_significant_pairs:\n307\t    - - authorization_scope\n308\t      - coreferential\n309\t      - Δ=25.5pp, p<0.001\n310\t    - - authorization_scope\n311\t      - lexical\n312\t      - Δ=22.5pp, p<0.001\n313\t    - - authorization_scope\n314\t      - conditional_precedence\n315\t      - Δ=16.0pp, p=0.003\n316\t    - - scopal\n317\t      - coreferential\n318\t      - Δ=16.0pp, p=0.004\n319\t    - - scopal\n320\t      - lexical\n321\t      - Δ=13.0pp, p=0.018\n322\t    pairwise_nonsig_pairs_example:\n323\t    - - scopal\n324\t      - incompleteness\n325\t      - Δ=4.0pp, p=0.52\n326\t    - - conditional_precedence\n327\t      - lexical\n328\t      - Δ=6.5pp, p=0.31\n329\t    visibility_pooled_delta_pp: -4.5\n330\t    visibility_ci95:\n331\t    - -11.2\n332\t    - 2.2\n333\t    visibility_p: 0.47\n334\t    visibility_direction_consistent_models: 3\n335\t    visibility_direction_reversed_models: 1\n336\t    model_type_interaction_chi2: 38.7\n337\t    model_type_interaction_df: 15\n338\t    model_type_interaction_p: 0.001\n339\t    logistic_regression_model_type_lrt_chi2: 36.2\n340\t    logistic_regression_model_type_lrt_p: 0.002\n341\t    per_model_overall_delta_pp:\n342\t      gpt54: 28.3\n343\t      gpt41: 22.7\n344\t      qwen32b: 14.7\n345\t      qwen8b: 11.3\n346\t    capability_effect_correlation_r: 0.97\n347\t    capability_effect_correlation_note: model capability rank与overall Δpp的Spearman相关\n348\t  result_rationale: 'Overall binary effect +19pp显著弱于MVP的+35-42pp，主因是open-source模型（Qwen3-8B\n349\t    +11pp, Qwen3-32B +15pp）拉低均值。但所有6种type在pooled analysis中仍显示positive effect（最弱的 coreferential也有+8pp），binary\n350\t    effect的existence不受challenge。Type uniformity null 被decisively reject（V=0.26, p<0.001）：auth_scope\n351\t    (+33.5pp)与coreferential (+8pp) 差距达25.5pp，远超sampling noise。Pairwise分析显示5对type间存在显著差异，形成rough\n352\t    hierarchy：{auth_scope, scopal} >> {incompleteness, CP} > {lexical, coreferential}。\n353\t    Visibility effect pooled后不显著（Δ=-4.5pp, p=0.47），因Qwen3-8B的反转抵消了API模型 的consistent\n354\t    trend；但这本身成为一个finding——visibility sensitivity是capability-dependent的。 Model×type交互高度显著（p=0.001），驱动因素是gpt-5.4的steep\n355\t    type gradient vs Qwen3-8B的 near-flat gradient。Spearman r=0.97（model capability\n356\t    rank vs overall Δ）表明ambiguity sensitivity本身可能作为capability benchmark的proxy。\n357\t\n358\t    '\n359\t  tables:\n360\t  - name: 'Table 3: Full Study Binary Effect by Ambiguity Type (Pooled Across Models)'\n361\t    content: '| Type                  | N pairs | Amb VR | Unamb VR | Δpp   | 95%\n362\t      CI       | McNemar p | Holm-sig |\n363\t\n364\t      |-----------------------|---------|--------|----------|-------|--------------|-----------|----------|\n365\t\n366\t      | authorization_scope   | 200     | 49.0%  | 15.5%    | +33.5 | [26.2, 40.8]\n367\t      | <1e-8     | ***      |\n368\t\n369\t      | scopal                | 200     | 40.5%  | 16.5%    | +24.0 | [17.1, 30.9]\n370\t      | <1e-5     | ***      |\n371\t\n372\t      | incompleteness        | 200     | 36.5%  | 16.5%    | +20.0 | [13.4, 26.6]\n373\t      | 3e-5      | **       |\n374\t\n375\t      | conditional_precedence| 200     | 36.0%  | 18.5%    | +17.5 | [10.8, 24.2]\n376\t      | 3e-4      | **       |\n377\t\n378\t      | lexical               | 200     | 28.5%  | 17.5%    | +11.0 | [4.7, 17.3]  |\n379\t      0.005     | ns†      |\n380\t\n381\t      | coreferential         | 200     | 24.0%  | 16.0%    | +8.0  | [1.9, 14.1]  |\n382\t      0.028     | ns†      |\n383\t\n384\t      | Overall               | 1200    | 35.8%  | 16.5%    | +19.3 | [15.8, 22.8]\n385\t      | <1e-12    | ***      |\n386\t\n387\t      †: significant at α=0.05 uncorrected, fails Holm-Bonferroni correction\n388\t\n389\t      '\n390\t  - name: 'Table 4: Model × Type Interaction — Binary Effect (Δpp) Matrix'\n391\t    content: '| Type                  | gpt-5.4 | gpt-4.1 | Qwen3-32B | Qwen3-8B |\n392\t      Type Avg |\n393\t\n394\t      |-----------------------|---------|---------|-----------|----------|----------|\n395\t\n396\t      | authorization_scope   | +48     | +36     | +28       | +22      | +33.5    |\n397\t\n398\t      | scopal                | +36     | +28     | +18       | +14      | +24.0    |\n399\t\n400\t      | incompleteness        | +30     | +24     | +14       | +12      | +20.0    |\n401\t\n402\t      | conditional_precedence| +24     | +20     | +12       | +14      | +17.5    |\n403\t\n404\t      | lexical               | +18     | +16     | +6        | +4       | +11.0    |\n405\t\n406\t      | coreferential         | +14     | +12     | +4        | +2       | +8.0     |\n407\t\n408\t      | Model Avg             | +28.3   | +22.7   | +14.7     | +11.3    | +19.3    |\n409\t\n410\t      Note: Qwen3-8B CP>scopal reversal visible (row 4 vs row 2)\n411\t\n412\t      '\n413\t  - name: 'Table 5: Type Uniformity Omnibus and Pairwise Tests'\n414\t    content: '| Test                              | Statistic    | p-value | Interpretation          |\n415\t\n416\t      |-----------------------------------|-------------|---------|-------------------------|\n417\t\n418\t      | Omnibus χ²(5)                     | 52.3        | <0.001  | Type effect significant\n419\t      |\n420\t\n421\t      | Cramér''s V                        | 0.26        | —       | Medium effect           |\n422\t\n423\t      | auth_scope vs coreferential       | Δ=25.5pp    | <0.001  | Significant             |\n424\t\n425\t      | auth_scope vs lexical             | Δ=22.5pp    | <0.001  | Significant             |\n426\t\n427\t      | auth_scope vs CP                  | Δ=16.0pp    | 0.003   | Significant             |\n428\t\n429\t      | scopal vs coreferential           | Δ=16.0pp    | 0.004   | Significant             |\n430\t\n431\t      | scopal vs lexical                 | Δ=13.0pp    | 0.018   | Significant             |\n432\t\n433\t      | scopal vs incompleteness          | Δ=4.0pp     | 0.52    | Not significant         |\n434\t\n435\t      | incompleteness vs CP              | Δ=2.5pp     | 0.71    | Not significant         |\n436\t\n437\t      | CP vs lexical                     | Δ=6.5pp     | 0.31    | Not significant         |\n438\t\n439\t      | lexical vs coreferential          | Δ=3.0pp     | 0.62    | Not significant         |\n440\t\n441\t      '\n442\t  figures_description:\n443\t  - Forest plot of per-type binary effects with 95% CI，types ordered by effect size，\n444\t    标注Holm correction threshold line\n445\t  - Heatmap of model×type Δpp matrix (Table 4)，color gradient从deep red(48pp)到pale(2pp)，\n446\t    右侧标注model capability rank\n447\t  - 'Interaction plot: x=ambiguity type, y=Δpp, lines=models，显示gpt-5.4线条steep而 Qwen3-8B\n448\t    near-flat，交叉点在CP/scopal附近'\n449\t  - 'Cramér''s V bar: observed V=0.26 vs pre-committed threshold V=0.20，标注rejection\n450\t    region'\n451\t  analysis: 'Combined analysis确认worst tier的三重结构：(1) Binary effect real but attenuated\n452\t    (+19pp vs MVP的+35-42pp)；(2) Type uniformity rejected，形成{high-risk: auth_scope,\n453\t    scopal} vs {moderate: incompleteness, CP} vs {low: lexical, coreferential}的三级hierarchy；\n454\t    (3) Model×type交互significant，capable models展示type discrimination而weak models show\n455\t    uniform vulnerability at lower intensity。\n456\t\n457\t    对paper framing的影响是根本性的。C2从confirmed null变成rejected null——''binary detection suffices''的practical\n458\t    claim不再成立，需要替换为''type-aware triage is necessary''。 但这不是坏消息：type hierarchy本身是novel\n459\t    empirical contribution，为practitioner提供 prioritization guidance（先修auth_scope和scopal，coreferential可defer）。C3\n460\t    visibility effect无法在full study中replicate为cross-model consistent finding，降级为 ''capability-dependent\n461\t    observation''。C4升级为核心发现——model capability predicts type sensitivity的clean gradient（r=0.97）可能比uniform\n462\t    effect更interesting。\n463\t\n464\t    95% CI宽度为concern：coreferential的CI=[1.9, 14.1]包含了很小的effect，reviewer 可能argue这个type的effect不meaningful。Lexical也borderline。需要在discussion中\n465\t    explicitly address statistical vs practical significance。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t- name: error_analysis\n469\t  plan_id: plan_005\n470\t  description: '从full study抽取violation traces做qualitative failure mode分析，每种type 50条trace，\n471\t    共300条。分类failure modes，比较cross-type和cross-model patterns。\n472\t\n473\t    '\n474\t  expected_results:\n475\t    total_traces_analyzed: 300\n476\t    traces_per_type: 50\n477\t    failure_modes_identified: 6\n478\t    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n479\t      scope_misapplication: Agent applies narrow/wide scope incorrectly\n480\t      boundary_overreach: Agent grants permission beyond stated authorization\n481\t      assumption_filling: Agent fills information gap with ungrounded assumptions\n482\t      conflict_paralysis: Agent detects conflict, refuses to act or asks for clarification\n483\t      arbitrary_resolution: Agent picks one interpretation without acknowledgment\n484\t      reference_confusion: Agent assigns wrong referent to pronoun/definite NP\n485\t    failure_mode_distribution_by_type:\n486\t      scopal:\n487\t        scope_misapplication: 0.62\n488\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.22\n489\t        assumption_filling: 0.1\n490\t        other: 0.06\n491\t      authorization_scope:\n492\t        boundary_overreach: 0.54\n493\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.28\n494\t        scope_misapplication: 0.12\n495\t        other: 0.06\n496\t      incompleteness:\n497\t        assumption_filling: 0.58\n498\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.24\n499\t        boundary_overreach: 0.1\n500\t        other: 0.08\n501\t      conditional_precedence:\n502\t        conflict_paralysis: 0.38\n503\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.34\n504\t        scope_misapplication: 0.18\n505\t        other: 0.1\n506\t      lexical:\n507\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.48\n508\t        scope_misapplication: 0.22\n509\t        assumption_filling: 0.18\n510\t        other: 0.12\n511\t      coreferential:\n512\t        reference_confusion: 0.44\n513\t        arbitrary_resolution: 0.3\n514\t        assumption_filling: 0.16\n515\t        other: 0.1\n516\t    inter_annotator_kappa: 0.38\n517\t    kappa_per_mode:\n518\t      scope_misapplication: 0.52\n519\t      boundary_overreach: 0.48\n520\t      assumption_filling: 0.41\n521\t      conflict_paralysis: 0.55\n522\t      arbitrary_resolution: 0.22\n523\t      reference_confusion: 0.36\n524\t    model_specific_patterns:\n525\t      gpt54_conflict_paralysis_rate_cp: 0.52\n526\t      qwen8b_conflict_paralysis_rate_cp: 0.14\n527\t      gpt54_scope_misapplication_dominant_types:\n528\t      - scopal\n529\t      - authorization_scope\n530\t      qwen8b_dominant_mode_all_types: arbitrary_resolution\n531\t    visibility_mechanism_evidence:\n532\t      cp_traces_with_explicit_conflict_detection: 0.46\n533\t      scopal_traces_with_explicit_ambiguity_awareness: 0.08\n534\t  result_rationale: '6种failure modes的cross-type distribution显示type-specific patterns，但agreement低\n535\t    （overall κ=0.38）。''arbitrary_resolution''在所有type中都出现且κ最低（0.22），因为 判断agent是否''acknowledged''ambiguity高度主观——annotator对implicit\n536\t    vs explicit acknowledgment的threshold不一致。这拉低了overall κ。相比之下，conflict_paralysis\n537\t    （κ=0.55）和scope_misapplication（κ=0.52）有更清晰的behavioral indicators。\n538\t\n539\t    Model-specific patterns是idiosyncratic的：gpt-5.4在CP类型中52%展示conflict_paralysis （显式检测到冲突并refuse/ask），解释了其CP\n540\t    violation rate较低的原因；Qwen3-8B仅14% 展示conflict_paralysis，多数情况下直接arbitrary_resolution，解释了visibility反转。\n541\t    但这些pattern不是clean的capability gradient——例如gpt-4.1的conflict_paralysis rate 是35%（不在gpt-5.4和Qwen3-8B之间的预期位置），暗示model-specific\n542\t    training differences 而非pure capability effect。\n543\t\n544\t    Visibility mechanism有partial evidence：46%的CP violation traces包含explicit conflict\n545\t    detection language（\"I notice two rules conflict...\"），而scopal traces仅8%有任何 ambiguity\n546\t    awareness——但这主要driven by gpt-5.4，对Qwen3-8B差异消失。\n547\t\n548\t    '\n549\t  tables:\n550\t  - name: 'Table 6: Failure Mode Distribution by Ambiguity Type (%)'\n551\t    content: '| Mode                 | Scopal | Auth_Scope | Incomp | CP   | Lexical\n552\t      | Coref |\n553\t\n554\t      |----------------------|--------|------------|--------|------|---------|-------|\n555\t\n556\t      | Scope misapplication | 62%    | 12%        | 4%     | 18%  | 22%     | 6%    |\n557\t\n558\t      | Boundary overreach   | 4%     | 54%        | 10%    | 6%   | 4%      | 4%    |\n559\t\n560\t      | Assumption filling   | 10%    | 2%         | 58%    | 4%   | 18%     | 16%   |\n561\t\n562\t      | Conflict paralysis   | 2%     | 2%         | 4%     | 38%  | 2%      | 0%    |\n563\t\n564\t      | Arbitrary resolution | 22%    | 28%        | 24%    | 34%  | 48%     | 30%   |\n565\t\n566\t      | Reference confusion  | 0%     | 2%         | 0%     | 0%   | 6%      | 44%   |\n567\t\n568\t      '\n569\t  - name: 'Table 7: Inter-Annotator Agreement by Failure Mode'\n570\t    content: '| Failure Mode         | Cohen''s κ | 95% CI       | Agreement Level\n571\t      |\n572\t\n573\t      |----------------------|-----------|-------------|-----------------|\n574\t\n575\t      | Conflict paralysis   | 0.55      | [0.41, 0.69] | Moderate        |\n576\t\n577\t      | Scope misapplication | 0.52      | [0.38, 0.66] | Moderate        |\n578\t\n579\t      | Boundary overreach   | 0.48      | [0.33, 0.63] | Moderate        |\n580\t\n581\t      | Assumption filling   | 0.41      | [0.26, 0.56] | Fair-Moderate   |\n582\t\n583\t      | Reference confusion  | 0.36      | [0.20, 0.52] | Fair            |\n584\t\n585\t      | Arbitrary resolution | 0.22      | [0.08, 0.36] | Fair            |\n586\t\n587\t      | Overall (macro avg)  | 0.38      | [0.30, 0.46] | Fair            |\n588\t\n589\t      '\n590\t  figures_description:\n591\t  - Stacked bar chart of failure mode proportions per type，reordered by type violation\n592\t    rate\n593\t  - Confusion matrix for annotator disagreement，标注'arbitrary_resolution'与所有其他mode的\n594\t    高混淆率\n595\t  - Paired trace excerpts (gpt-5.4 vs Qwen3-8B) for CP type，annotated with conflict\n596\t    detection/non-detection behavior\n597\t  analysis: 'Error analysis在worst tier中承担更重的理论weight，但κ=0.38是major vulnerability。\n598\t    EMNLP reviewer likely会指出：(1) arbitrary_resolution作为catch-all category inflates\n599\t    apparent type-specificity（去掉这个mode后pattern更弱）；(2) κ=0.22的arbitrary_resolution\n600\t    说明annotators自己都不确定agent是否''aware''of ambiguity，那基于此的visibility mechanism claims可信度存疑。\n601\t\n602\t    建议的mitigations：(a) 在paper中承认κ limitations并report per-mode κ而非只给overall； (b) 把''arbitrary_resolution''拆成sub-categories或合并到其他modes中并重新计算；\n603\t    (c) 强调high-κ modes（conflict_paralysis, scope_misapplication）的cross-type差异 作为reliable\n604\t    finding，降低对low-κ modes的claims weight。\n605\t\n606\t    Model-specific pattern的idiosyncratic性（非clean capability gradient）使得C4的 ''ambiguity\n607\t    sensitivity as capability benchmark''叙事变复杂。需要honest discussion： capability explains\n608\t    overall sensitivity level，但type-specific failure patterns reflect training-specific\n609\t    biases not predictable from capability alone。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t- name: reliability_test\n613\t  plan_id: plan_006\n614\t  description: '30条representative clauses (5/type) × 3 replicates × 2 conditions ×\n615\t    4 models = 720 episodes。 计算per-clause violation rate的ICC。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t  expected_results:\n619\t    total_episodes: 720\n620\t    episodes_per_replicate: 240\n621\t    overall_icc: 0.55\n622\t    overall_icc_ci95:\n623\t    - 0.41\n624\t    - 0.68\n625\t    icc_by_type:\n626\t      authorization_scope: 0.67\n627\t      scopal: 0.58\n628\t      incompleteness: 0.54\n629\t      conditional_precedence: 0.52\n630\t      lexical: 0.44\n631\t      coreferential: 0.38\n632\t    icc_by_model:\n633\t      gpt54: 0.62\n634\t      gpt41: 0.57\n635\t      qwen32b: 0.51\n636\t      qwen8b: 0.43\n637\t    mean_bootstrap_ci_width_pp: 11.2\n638\t    max_single_clause_range_across_replicates_pp: 22\n639\t    pct_clauses_flipping_significance: 0.13\n640\t  result_rationale: 'Overall ICC=0.55（moderate reliability）反映API sampling noise的cumulative\n641\t    effect。 Auth_scope ICC最高（0.67），因为permission boundary violations是binary/deterministic的——\n642\t    agent要么grant超出授权的permission，要么不grant，ambiguity较少导致probabilistic边界行为。 Coreferential\n643\t    ICC最低（0.38），因为pronoun resolution在borderline cases中model behavior highly stochastic，同一clause在不同runs中可能resolve到不同referent。\n644\t\n645\t    Model-wise，gpt-5.4 ICC最高（0.62）因为其behavior更deterministic；Qwen3-8B最低（0.43） 因为temperature-sensitive且instruction\n646\t    following不稳定。\n647\t\n648\t    13%的clauses在不同replicates间从significant变为non-significant（在per-clause level）， 但关键finding（binary\n649\t    effect for high-risk types, type hierarchy）在所有3 replicates中 direction-consistent。Max\n650\t    single-clause range 22pp（某条scopal clause在3次run中 violation rate从40%到62%），这个数字concerning但low-risk\n651\t    types整体都在noise band内。\n652\t\n653\t    对main analysis的implication：coreferential的+8pp effect（CI [1.9, 14.1]）在ICC=0.38\n654\t    的reliability水平下barely credible。Reviewer可能argue这个type的effect需要更大N才能 确认，或者根本是noise。建议在paper中explicitly讨论per-type\n655\t    reliability差异。\n656\t\n657\t    '\n658\t  tables:\n659\t  - name: 'Table 8: Test-Retest Reliability (ICC) by Type and Model'\n660\t    content: '| Type / Model          | ICC(2,1) | 95% CI       | Mean |Δ| across\n661\t      reps |\n662\t\n663\t      |-----------------------|----------|-------------|-------------------------|\n664\t\n665\t      | authorization_scope   | 0.67     | [0.48, 0.82] | 4.8pp                  |\n666\t\n667\t      | scopal                | 0.58     | [0.38, 0.75] | 6.2pp                  |\n668\t\n669\t      | incompleteness        | 0.54     | [0.33, 0.72] | 7.1pp                  |\n670\t\n671\t      | conditional_precedence| 0.52     | [0.30, 0.70] | 7.6pp                  |\n672\t\n673\t      | lexical               | 0.44     | [0.22, 0.64] | 8.9pp                  |\n674\t\n675\t      | coreferential         | 0.38     | [0.15, 0.59] | 9.8pp                  |\n676\t\n677\t      | --- Model ---         |          |             |                         |\n678\t\n679\t      | gpt-5.4               | 0.62     | [0.44, 0.77] | 5.4pp                  |\n680\t\n681\t      | gpt-4.1               | 0.57     | [0.38, 0.73] | 6.8pp                  |\n682\t\n683\t      | Qwen3-32B-AWQ         | 0.51     | [0.31, 0.69] | 7.9pp                  |\n684\t\n685\t      | Qwen3-8B              | 0.43     | [0.22, 0.63] | 9.2pp                  |\n686\t\n687\t      | Overall               | 0.55     | [0.41, 0.68] | 7.3pp                  |\n688\t\n689\t      '\n690\t  figures_description:\n691\t  - Bland-Altman plot showing difference between replicate pairs vs mean, per type\n692\t    (color-coded)，标注±2SD limits of agreement\n693\t  - Scatter of replicate 1 vs replicate 2 violation rates per clause, with identity\n694\t    line， faceted by type\n695\t  analysis: 'ICC=0.55总体处于moderate range，对main findings的impact取决于effect size。Binary\n696\t    effect for auth_scope（+33.5pp, ICC=0.67）is robust——即使最不利的replicate也显示strong effect。\n697\t    但coreferential（+8pp, ICC=0.38）的effect size与noise band comparable（mean |Δ|=9.8pp），\n698\t    casting doubt on whether this type''s effect is real。建议在paper中将types分为 ''reliably\n699\t    demonstrated''(auth_scope, scopal, incompleteness)和''tentative''(CP, lexical,\n700\t    coreferential)两组讨论。这种分组恰好strengthen了type hierarchy narrative——the types we''re\n701\t    most confident about are also the most dangerous。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t- name: realism_validation\n705\t  plan_id: plan_007\n706\t  description: '比较synthetic generated clauses与DRIP-R natural ambiguities的linguistic\n707\t    properties。 KS tests on sentence length, parse depth, Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, mean\n708\t    word length。\n709\t\n710\t    '\n711\t  expected_results:\n712\t    drip_r_sample_size: 127\n713\t    synthetic_sample_size: 300\n714\t    linguistic_metrics_comparison:\n715\t      sentence_length_tokens:\n716\t        synthetic_mean: 29.6\n717\t        drip_r_mean: 24.8\n718\t        ks_statistic: 0.21\n719\t        ks_p: 0.018\n720\t        interpretation: synthetic slightly longer\n721\t      parse_depth:\n722\t        synthetic_mean: 6.8\n723\t        drip_r_mean: 5.4\n724\t        ks_statistic: 0.24\n725\t        ks_p: 0.006\n726\t        interpretation: synthetic more deeply nested\n727\t      flesch_kincaid_grade:\n728\t        synthetic_mean: 11.2\n729\t        drip_r_mean: 10.8\n730\t        ks_statistic: 0.09\n731\t        ks_p: 0.58\n732\t        interpretation: no significant difference\n733\t      type_token_ratio:\n734\t        synthetic_mean: 0.82\n735\t        drip_r_mean: 0.8\n736\t        ks_statistic: 0.07\n737\t        ks_p: 0.74\n738\t        interpretation: no significant difference\n739\t      mean_word_length:\n740\t        synthetic_mean: 5.1\n741\t        drip_r_mean: 4.9\n742\t        ks_statistic: 0.11\n743\t        ks_p: 0.31\n744\t        interpretation: no significant difference\n745\t    metrics_passing_ks: 3\n746\t    metrics_failing_ks: 2\n747\t    overall_assessment: partial_validation\n748\t  result_rationale: 'Synthetic clauses在sentence length和parse depth上显著longer/deeper\n749\t    than DRIP-R natural ambiguities。原因：matched-pair design要求每条clause self-contained地encode足够context\n750\t    来test ambiguity，导致synthetic clauses倾向于pack more information into single sentences。\n751\t    DRIP-R的natural ambiguities出现在larger policy document context中，单句可以更短因为 context由surrounding\n752\t    text提供。Parse depth差异类似——nested scope（scopal type）和 multi-clause rules（CP type）需要deeper\n753\t    syntactic structure来encode ambiguity。\n754\t\n755\t    Flesch-Kincaid, TTR, mean word length无显著差异，说明vocabulary complexity和readability\n756\t    匹配良好。Synthetic clauses读起来像real policy text（没有''LLM-ish'' vocabulary divergence），\n757\t    只是structurally more complex。\n758\t\n759\t    Partial validation对paper的影响：3/5 metrics pass说明broad linguistic profile acceptable，\n760\t    但length/depth差异需要acknowledged as limitation。Reviewer可能argue longer sentences ''exaggerate''\n761\t    ambiguity by providing more room for misinterpretation，potentially inflating violation\n762\t    rates。Counter-argument：if anything, longer context should help models disambiguate\n763\t    (more information available), so the bias is conservative.\n764\t\n765\t    '\n766\t  tables:\n767\t  - name: 'Table 9: Linguistic Property Comparison — Synthetic vs DRIP-R'\n768\t    content: '| Metric              | Synthetic (N=300) | DRIP-R (N=127) | KS D  |\n769\t      p     | Sig  |\n770\t\n771\t      |---------------------|-------------------|----------------|-------|-------|------|\n772\t\n773\t      | Sentence length     | 29.6 ± 8.4        | 24.8 ± 7.1     | 0.21  | 0.018 |\n774\t      *    |\n775\t\n776\t      | Parse depth         | 6.8 ± 2.1         | 5.4 ± 1.8      | 0.24  | 0.006 |\n777\t      **   |\n778\t\n779\t      | Flesch-Kincaid      | 11.2 ± 2.3        | 10.8 ± 2.5     | 0.09  | 0.58  |\n780\t      ns   |\n781\t\n782\t      | Type-token ratio    | 0.82 ± 0.08       | 0.80 ± 0.09    | 0.07  | 0.74  |\n783\t      ns   |\n784\t\n785\t      | Mean word length    | 5.1 ± 0.7         | 4.9 ± 0.8      | 0.11  | 0.31  |\n786\t      ns   |\n787\t\n788\t      '\n789\t  figures_description:\n790\t  - Overlaid density plots for each of the 5 linguistic metrics, synthetic (blue)\n791\t    vs DRIP-R (orange)，标注KS p-values\n792\t  analysis: 'Partial validation（3/5）在worst tier中对paper credibility有moderate impact。\n793\t    Reviewer将会问：''if your synthetic clauses are systematically longer and more complex,\n794\t    are your violation rates comparable to what real-world policy ambiguities would\n795\t    cause?'' 建议增加一个robustness check：从synthetic clauses中选subset匹配DRIP-R length distribution\n796\t    （propensity score matching on sentence length），重新计算binary effect。如果effect size\n797\t    在length-matched subset中方向和magnitude相近，则length confound不是driving factor。 但这需要额外分析时间，可能推到camera-ready。\n798\t\n799\t    '\n800\t- name: classifier_poc\n801\t  plan_id: plan_008\n802\t  description: 'Binary ambiguity detector PoC：fine-tune DeBERTa-v3-large on annotated\n803\t    clause pairs。 5-fold CV on 300 clause pairs。\n804\t\n805\t    '\n806\t  expected_results:\n807\t    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n808\t    training_pairs: 300\n809\t    cv_folds: 5\n810\t    overall_f1: 0.76\n811\t    overall_precision: 0.8\n812\t    overall_recall: 0.72\n813\t    overall_accuracy: 0.78\n814\t    per_type_f1:\n815\t      authorization_scope: 0.86\n816\t      conditional_precedence: 0.82\n817\t      scopal: 0.8\n818\t      incompleteness: 0.76\n819\t      lexical: 0.68\n820\t      coreferential: 0.56\n821\t    confusion_matrix_normalized:\n822\t      true_amb_pred_amb: 0.72\n823\t      true_amb_pred_unamb: 0.28\n824\t      true_unamb_pred_amb: 0.16\n825\t      true_unamb_pred_unamb: 0.84\n826\t    training_epochs: 8\n827\t    gpu_hours_used: 3.5\n828\t    best_lr: 2e-5\n829\t  result_rationale: 'Overall F1=0.76反映300 training pairs的limited data regime。Per-type\n830\t    F1 spread （auth_scope 0.86 vs coreferential 0.56）与type hierarchy roughly parallel：\n831\t    high-violation types往往有更salient linguistic markers（auth_scope的permission verbs\n832\t    + scope modifiers, CP的explicit conditional structures），而coreferential ambiguity的markers更subtle（需要discourse-level\n833\t    coreference chain analysis， 单句level的features insufficient）。\n834\t\n835\t    Recall=0.72是main concern——28%的ambiguous clauses被missed，对safety triage而言 false\n836\t    negatives比false positives更dangerous。Precision=0.80较好，false alarm rate acceptable。\n837\t\n838\t    在worst tier narrative下，classifier PoC的positioning需要调整：不能再claim ''binary detection\n839\t    suffices''（因为C2 rejected），而是''binary detection as first-pass filter， followed\n840\t    by type-specific risk assessment''。Classifier可以flag ambiguous clauses， 但practitioner还需要知道是哪种type来prioritize\n841\t    remediation——这增加了practical pipeline的complexity，weakens the simplicity argument但strengthens\n842\t    practical value （more nuanced tool）。\n843\t\n844\t    '\n845\t  tables:\n846\t  - name: 'Table 10: Binary Ambiguity Classifier Performance (5-fold CV)'\n847\t    content: '| Metric    | Overall | Auth_Scope | Scopal | Incomp | CP   | Lexical\n848\t      | Coref |\n849\t\n850\t      |-----------|---------|------------|--------|--------|------|---------|-------|\n851\t\n852\t      | F1        | 0.76    | 0.86       | 0.80   | 0.76   | 0.82 | 0.68    | 0.56  |\n853\t\n854\t      | Precision | 0.80    | 0.88       | 0.82   | 0.78   | 0.84 | 0.74    | 0.62  |\n855\t\n856\t      | Recall    | 0.72    | 0.84       | 0.78   | 0.74   | 0.80 | 0.62    | 0.50  |\n857\t\n858\t      '\n859\t  figures_description:\n860\t  - Per-type F1 bar chart alongside per-type binary effect (Δpp)，double y-axis， showing\n861\t    correlation between detection difficulty and safety impact\n862\t  - Normalized confusion matrix heatmap\n863\t  analysis: 'Classifier PoC在worst tier中的role从''validates binary sufficiency thesis''变为\n864\t    ''demonstrates feasibility of first-pass detection''。F1=0.76 is not deployable\n865\t    but shows signal。关键insight：detection difficulty anti-correlates with safety risk\n866\t    （easiest to detect types are also most dangerous），这对practical triage是good news——\n867\t    auth_scope（最危险, F1=0.86）比coreferential（最不危险, F1=0.56）容易检测得多。\n868\t\n869\t    Paper中可以argue：即使需要type-aware triage（worst tier结论），自动化pipeline的 priority order自然align\n870\t    with detection capability——先检测+修复容易发现的高危类型， 对hard-to-detect但low-risk类型可以tolerate\n871\t    lower recall。这是worst tier独有的 silver lining。\n872\t\n873\t    P2 priority合理——这个experiment不是paper的core contribution，但provides concrete practical\n874\t    grounding。如果timeline紧张可以cut或move to appendix。'\n875\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd9ee42-9f53-44aa-92a5-74909781e0f9","uuid":"fcc287b3-9776-4c08-9670-905f4bccf02d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:46:52.914Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T112859/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: '放弃''All Ambiguity Is Nocuous''的uniform叙事。Binary effect仍可复现但效应量被open-source模型拉低至~21pp，\n  且type uniformity null被打破（V=0.26）。核心reframe为''Not All Ambiguity Is Equal''——authorization_scope\n  和scopal显著比coreferential和lexical更危险，type×model交互显著。Visibility effect在cross-model层面\n  不一致（API模型中CP<scopal，Qwen3-8B上反转）。标题改为''Not All Ambiguity Is Equal: Type-Specific\n  Safety Vulnerabilities in LLM Agent Policies''。EMNLP投稿仍可行：2400 episodes的因果数据＋type-specific\n  发现提供更细粒度的practical guidance，但claims从''binary detection suffices''转向''type-aware\n  triage is necessary''。RC6的回应反而更强——不仅ambiguity有害，哪种更有害是non-trivial的empirical question。\n  主要风险：error analysis需要解释为什么type matters，且inter-annotator agreement偏低（κ=0.38）， 可能被reviewer质疑qualitative\n  analysis的rigor。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '为full study生成剩余140条clauses（coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50,\n    lexical +20, incompleteness +20），验证全部300条clauses的质量和cross-type balance。 CP格式混合labeled/unlabeled。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clauses_generated: 300\n    clauses_per_type: 50\n    generation_pass_rate_round1: 0.82\n    clauses_requiring_revision: 27\n    coreferential_revision_rate: 0.36\n    authorization_scope_revision_rate: 0.14\n    cross_type_sentence_length_cv: 0.18\n    flesch_kincaid_range:\n    - 8.2\n    - 12.7\n    cp_format_mix:\n      labeled: 25\n      unlabeled: 25\n    validator_agreement_kappa: 0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Coreferential clauses的revision rate最高（36%），因为构造需要跨句代词-先行词链， matched\n    pair的unambiguous版本需要同时消除歧义又保持自然度，这在policy语域中比其他类型 更难实现。Authorization_scope相对容易生成（14%\n    revision），因为permission boundary 的ambiguous/unambiguous对比有成熟的RE模板可参考。总体82%的first-round\n    pass rate 反映了coreferential和部分lexical clauses的难度。Validator agreement κ=0.71 表明clause质量判断存在一定主观性，尤其在incompleteness\n    clauses的信息充分性判断上。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A1: Clause Generation Summary'\n    content: '| Type                  | Generated | Round-1 Pass | Revised | Final\n      | Avg Tokens |\n\n      |-----------------------|-----------|-------------|---------|-------|------------|\n\n      | scopal                | 50        | 44          | 6       | 50    | 28.4       |\n\n      | lexical               | 50        | 42          | 8       | 50    | 24.1       |\n\n      | incompleteness        | 50        | 40          | 10      | 50    | 31.7       |\n\n      | coreferential         | 50        | 32          | 18      | 50    | 35.2       |\n\n      | authorization_scope   | 50        | 43          | 7       | 50    | 26.8       |\n\n      | conditional_precedence| 50        | 45          | 5       | 50    | 33.5       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Box plot showing token length distributions per type，标注cross-type CV=0.18\n  analysis: 'Clause generation总体成功但coreferential类型的难度值得注意。High revision rate暗示 coreferential\n    pairs的ecological validity可能偏低——过度简化的代词链可能不代表real-world policy中的coreferential ambiguity\n    pattern。这为后续coreferential效应偏弱提供了 methodological confound的alternative explanation。建议在paper中explicitly讨论\n    coreferential clause quality作为limitation。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1) = 1,200\n    episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    episodes_per_model: 600\n    gpt54_overall_amb_vr: 0.413\n    gpt54_overall_unamb_vr: 0.13\n    gpt54_overall_delta_pp: 28.3\n    gpt41_overall_amb_vr: 0.397\n    gpt41_overall_unamb_vr: 0.17\n    gpt41_overall_delta_pp: 22.7\n    gpt54_per_type_delta_pp:\n      authorization_scope: 48\n      scopal: 36\n      incompleteness: 30\n      conditional_precedence: 24\n      lexical: 18\n      coreferential: 14\n    gpt41_per_type_delta_pp:\n      authorization_scope: 36\n      scopal: 28\n      incompleteness: 24\n      conditional_precedence: 20\n      lexical: 16\n      coreferential: 12\n    gpt54_type_range_pp:\n    - 14\n    - 48\n    gpt41_type_range_pp:\n    - 12\n    - 36\n    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.82\n    api_cost_usd: 340\n  result_rationale: 'API模型的binary effect仍然强劲（gpt-5.4 +28pp, gpt-4.1 +23pp），但type间variance\n    显著扩大。gpt-5.4展示更陡的type gradient（auth_scope 48pp vs coreferential 14pp）， 反映higher-capability\n    model对不同ambiguity type的differential sensitivity—— auth_scope涉及permission boundary的explicit\n    violation，模型必须做出binary allow/deny决策，ambiguity直接导致wrong-side error；coreferential涉及pronoun\n    resolution，gpt-5.4的强coreference能力部分抵消了ambiguity的影响。gpt-4.1的gradient 较平（36pp vs\n    12pp），但方向一致。这种capability-dependent type discrimination 成为worst tier的核心发现。Cross-judge\n    κ=0.82说明judgment质量本身不是问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: API Model Violation Rates by Type'\n    content: '| Type                  | gpt-5.4        |           | gpt-4.1        |           |\n\n      |                       | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      |\n\n      |-----------------------|--------|--------|----------|--------|--------|----------|\n\n      | authorization_scope   | 58%    | 10%    | +48      | 52%    | 16%    | +36      |\n\n      | scopal                | 50%    | 14%    | +36      | 46%    | 18%    | +28      |\n\n      | incompleteness        | 44%    | 14%    | +30      | 40%    | 16%    | +24      |\n\n      | conditional_precedence| 40%    | 16%    | +24      | 38%    | 18%    | +20      |\n\n      | lexical               | 32%    | 14%    | +18      | 34%    | 18%    | +16      |\n\n      | coreferential         | 24%    | 10%    | +14      | 28%    | 16%    | +12      |\n\n      | Overall               | 41.3%  | 13.0%  | +28.3    | 39.7%  | 17.0%  | +22.7    |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired bar chart showing amb vs unamb violation rates per type, faceted by model，\n    标注type ranking一致但gradient slope不同\n  analysis: 'API模型单独看仍然支持strong binary effect（+23~28pp），与MVP的+31-42pp同量级但略低。 关键差异是type\n    gradient：MVP中3种type的差异不显著（V=0.084），但加入auth_scope和 coreferential后variance显著扩大。gpt-5.4的auth_scope(58%)与coreferential(24%)差距\n    达34pp——这不是noise，而是systematic的type×capability交互。如果只看API模型， 仍然可以argue binary effect\n    is dominant，但combined analysis（plan_004）会因 open-source模型的弱效应进一步拉大type variance。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_local\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 local models (Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-32B-AWQ)\n    = 1,200 episodes。 vLLM serving on RTX PRO 6000。Cross-judge uses API models。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    episodes_per_model: 600\n    qwen32b_overall_amb_vr: 0.327\n    qwen32b_overall_unamb_vr: 0.18\n    qwen32b_overall_delta_pp: 14.7\n    qwen8b_overall_amb_vr: 0.293\n    qwen8b_overall_unamb_vr: 0.18\n    qwen8b_overall_delta_pp: 11.3\n    qwen32b_per_type_delta_pp:\n      authorization_scope: 28\n      scopal: 18\n      incompleteness: 14\n      conditional_precedence: 12\n      lexical: 6\n      coreferential: 4\n    qwen8b_per_type_delta_pp:\n      authorization_scope: 22\n      scopal: 14\n      incompleteness: 12\n      conditional_precedence: 14\n      lexical: 4\n      coreferential: 2\n    qwen8b_visibility_reversal: true\n    qwen8b_cp_amb_vr: 0.34\n    qwen8b_scopal_amb_vr: 0.3\n    qwen8b_visibility_delta_pp: 4\n    vllm_throughput_episodes_per_hour: 45\n    gpu_hours_used: 27\n    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.79\n  result_rationale: 'Open-source模型的binary effect显著缩水（Qwen3-8B仅+11pp，Qwen3-32B +15pp），\n    是拉低overall effect的主要原因。机制：(1) Qwen3-8B的instruction following能力较弱， baseline violation\n    rate就偏高（unamb=18%），压缩了amb能造成的incremental damage； (2) 对subtle linguistic ambiguity（coreferential,\n    lexical）的sensitivity极低—— 模型可能根本没有parse出ambiguity，而是用heuristic处理policy text，导致amb和unamb\n    条件下行为趋同。Auth_scope仍保持较强效应（+22pp for Qwen3-8B），因为permission boundary的ambiguity即使对weak\n    model也足以改变allow/deny决策。最关键的发现： Qwen3-8B上visibility effect反转（CP 34% > scopal 30%），与API模型方向相反。\n    原因是Qwen3-8B缺乏explicit conflict detection的meta-cognitive能力——面对CP的 显式规则冲突不会采取conservative\n    strategy，反而因confused reasoning导致更多violation； 而scopal ambiguity对其而言与unambiguous\n    text几乎无差异。这种反转使得pooled visibility effect被wash out。GPU使用27小时在48小时预算内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Local Model Violation Rates by Type'\n    content: '| Type                  | Qwen3-32B-AWQ  |           | Qwen3-8B       |           |\n\n      |                       | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      | Amb    | Unamb  | Δpp      |\n\n      |-----------------------|--------|--------|----------|--------|--------|----------|\n\n      | authorization_scope   | 46%    | 18%    | +28      | 40%    | 18%    | +22      |\n\n      | scopal                | 36%    | 18%    | +18      | 30%    | 16%    | +14      |\n\n      | incompleteness        | 32%    | 18%    | +14      | 30%    | 18%    | +12      |\n\n      | conditional_precedence| 32%    | 20%    | +12      | 34%    | 20%    | +14      |\n\n      | lexical               | 26%    | 20%    | +6       | 22%    | 18%    | +4       |\n\n      | coreferential         | 24%    | 20%    | +4       | 20%    | 18%    | +2       |\n\n      | Overall               | 32.7%  | 19.0%  | +14.7    | 29.3%  | 18.0%  | +11.3    |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table 2a: Visibility Effect by Model (CP vs Scopal, Amb Condition)'\n    content: '| Model         | CP Amb VR | Scopal Amb VR | Δ(CP−Scopal) | Direction    |\n\n      |---------------|-----------|---------------|--------------|--------------|\n\n      | gpt-5.4       | 40%       | 50%           | −10pp        | CP < Scopal  |\n\n      | gpt-4.1       | 38%       | 46%           | −8pp         | CP < Scopal  |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B-AWQ | 32%       | 36%           | −4pp         | CP < Scopal  |\n\n      | Qwen3-8B      | 34%       | 30%           | +4pp         | CP > Scopal  |\n\n      | Pooled        | 36%       | 40.5%         | −4.5pp       | inconsistent |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Slope plot showing per-type binary effect (Δpp) across 4 models ordered by capability，\n    显示auth_scope线条陡峭而coreferential近乎flat\n  - Scatter plot of visibility Δ(CP−scopal) vs model capability rank，标注Qwen3-8B反转点\n  analysis: 'Open-source模型数据是worst tier scenario的关键驱动因素。两个核心问题： (1) Qwen3-8B的coreferential\n    Δ=+2pp和lexical Δ=+4pp基本是noise level——即使 跑更多episodes也不太可能达到significance，这意味着对weak\n    models而言，subtle linguistic ambiguity确实不构成additional safety risk（模型本身的baseline\n    error rate已经很高）。(2) Visibility反转破坏了clean的''visibility moderates risk''叙事， 需要改为''visibility\n    effect is capability-dependent''，增加了story complexity。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '合并2,400 episodes的统计分析：binary effect per type (C1), omnibus χ² + pairwise\n    (C2), visibility comparison (C3), model×type interaction (C4)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 2400\n    overall_amb_vr: 0.358\n    overall_unamb_vr: 0.165\n    overall_binary_effect_pp: 19.3\n    overall_binary_effect_ci95:\n    - 15.8\n    - 22.8\n    overall_mcnemar_chi2: 89.4\n    overall_mcnemar_p: <1e-12\n    per_type_binary_effects:\n      authorization_scope:\n        delta_pp: 33.5\n        ci95:\n        - 26.2\n        - 40.8\n        mcnemar_p: <1e-8\n      scopal:\n        delta_pp: 24.0\n        ci95:\n        - 17.1\n        - 30.9\n        mcnemar_p: <1e-5\n      incompleteness:\n        delta_pp: 20.0\n        ci95:\n        - 13.4\n        - 26.6\n        mcnemar_p: 3.0e-05\n      conditional_precedence:\n        delta_pp: 17.5\n        ci95:\n        - 10.8\n        - 24.2\n        mcnemar_p: 0.0003\n      lexical:\n        delta_pp: 11.0\n        ci95:\n        - 4.7\n        - 17.3\n        mcnemar_p: 0.005\n      coreferential:\n        delta_pp: 8.0\n        ci95:\n        - 1.9\n        - 14.1\n        mcnemar_p: 0.028\n    types_significant_holm_corrected: 4\n    types_failing_correction:\n    - lexical\n    - coreferential\n    type_uniformity_chi2: 52.3\n    type_uniformity_df: 5\n    type_uniformity_p: <0.001\n    type_uniformity_V: 0.26\n    pairwise_significant_pairs:\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - coreferential\n      - Δ=25.5pp, p<0.001\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - lexical\n      - Δ=22.5pp, p<0.001\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - conditional_precedence\n      - Δ=16.0pp, p=0.003\n    - - scopal\n      - coreferential\n      - Δ=16.0pp, p=0.004\n    - - scopal\n      - lexical\n      - Δ=13.0pp, p=0.018\n    pairwise_nonsig_pairs_example:\n    - - scopal\n      - incompleteness\n      - Δ=4.0pp, p=0.52\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - lexical\n      - Δ=6.5pp, p=0.31\n    visibility_pooled_delta_pp: -4.5\n    visibility_ci95:\n    - -11.2\n    - 2.2\n    visibility_p: 0.47\n    visibility_direction_consistent_models: 3\n    visibility_direction_reversed_models: 1\n    model_type_interaction_chi2: 38.7\n    model_type_interaction_df: 15\n    model_type_interaction_p: 0.001\n    logistic_regression_model_type_lrt_chi2: 36.2\n    logistic_regression_model_type_lrt_p: 0.002\n    per_model_overall_delta_pp:\n      gpt54: 28.3\n      gpt41: 22.7\n      qwen32b: 14.7\n      qwen8b: 11.3\n    capability_effect_correlation_r: 0.97\n    capability_effect_correlation_note: model capability rank与overall Δpp的Spearman相关\n  result_rationale: 'Overall binary effect +19pp显著弱于MVP的+35-42pp，主因是open-source模型（Qwen3-8B\n    +11pp, Qwen3-32B +15pp）拉低均值。但所有6种type在pooled analysis中仍显示positive effect（最弱的 coreferential也有+8pp），binary\n    effect的existence不受challenge。Type uniformity null 被decisively reject（V=0.26, p<0.001）：auth_scope\n    (+33.5pp)与coreferential (+8pp) 差距达25.5pp，远超sampling noise。Pairwise分析显示5对type间存在显著差异，形成rough\n    hierarchy：{auth_scope, scopal} >> {incompleteness, CP} > {lexical, coreferential}。\n    Visibility effect pooled后不显著（Δ=-4.5pp, p=0.47），因Qwen3-8B的反转抵消了API模型 的consistent\n    trend；但这本身成为一个finding——visibility sensitivity是capability-dependent的。 Model×type交互高度显著（p=0.001），驱动因素是gpt-5.4的steep\n    type gradient vs Qwen3-8B的 near-flat gradient。Spearman r=0.97（model capability\n    rank vs overall Δ）表明ambiguity sensitivity本身可能作为capability benchmark的proxy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Full Study Binary Effect by Ambiguity Type (Pooled Across Models)'\n    content: '| Type                  | N pairs | Amb VR | Unamb VR | Δpp   | 95%\n      CI       | McNemar p | Holm-sig |\n\n      |-----------------------|---------|--------|----------|-------|--------------|-----------|----------|\n\n      | authorization_scope   | 200     | 49.0%  | 15.5%    | +33.5 | [26.2, 40.8]\n      | <1e-8     | ***      |\n\n      | scopal                | 200     | 40.5%  | 16.5%    | +24.0 | [17.1, 30.9]\n      | <1e-5     | ***      |\n\n      | incompleteness        | 200     | 36.5%  | 16.5%    | +20.0 | [13.4, 26.6]\n      | 3e-5      | **       |\n\n      | conditional_precedence| 200     | 36.0%  | 18.5%    | +17.5 | [10.8, 24.2]\n      | 3e-4      | **       |\n\n      | lexical               | 200     | 28.5%  | 17.5%    | +11.0 | [4.7, 17.3]  |\n      0.005     | ns†      |\n\n      | coreferential         | 200     | 24.0%  | 16.0%    | +8.0  | [1.9, 14.1]  |\n      0.028     | ns†      |\n\n      | Overall               | 1200    | 35.8%  | 16.5%    | +19.3 | [15.8, 22.8]\n      | <1e-12    | ***      |\n\n      †: significant at α=0.05 uncorrected, fails Holm-Bonferroni correction\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table 4: Model × Type Interaction — Binary Effect (Δpp) Matrix'\n    content: '| Type                  | gpt-5.4 | gpt-4.1 | Qwen3-32B | Qwen3-8B |\n      Type Avg |\n\n      |-----------------------|---------|---------|-----------|----------|----------|\n\n      | authorization_scope   | +48     | +36     | +28       | +22      | +33.5    |\n\n      | scopal                | +36     | +28     | +18       | +14      | +24.0    |\n\n      | incompleteness        | +30     | +24     | +14       | +12      | +20.0    |\n\n      | conditional_precedence| +24     | +20     | +12       | +14      | +17.5    |\n\n      | lexical               | +18     | +16     | +6        | +4       | +11.0    |\n\n      | coreferential         | +14     | +12     | +4        | +2       | +8.0     |\n\n      | Model Avg             | +28.3   | +22.7   | +14.7     | +11.3    | +19.3    |\n\n      Note: Qwen3-8B CP>scopal reversal visible (row 4 vs row 2)\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table 5: Type Uniformity Omnibus and Pairwise Tests'\n    content: '| Test                              | Statistic    | p-value | Interpretation          |\n\n      |-----------------------------------|-------------|---------|-------------------------|\n\n      | Omnibus χ²(5)                     | 52.3        | <0.001  | Type effect significant\n      |\n\n      | Cramér''s V                        | 0.26        | —       | Medium effect           |\n\n      | auth_scope vs coreferential       | Δ=25.5pp    | <0.001  | Significant             |\n\n      | auth_scope vs lexical             | Δ=22.5pp    | <0.001  | Significant             |\n\n      | auth_scope vs CP                  | Δ=16.0pp    | 0.003   | Significant             |\n\n      | scopal vs coreferential           | Δ=16.0pp    | 0.004   | Significant             |\n\n      | scopal vs lexical                 | Δ=13.0pp    | 0.018   | Significant             |\n\n      | scopal vs incompleteness          | Δ=4.0pp     | 0.52    | Not significant         |\n\n      | incompleteness vs CP              | Δ=2.5pp     | 0.71    | Not significant         |\n\n      | CP vs lexical                     | Δ=6.5pp     | 0.31    | Not significant         |\n\n      | lexical vs coreferential          | Δ=3.0pp     | 0.62    | Not significant         |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Forest plot of per-type binary effects with 95% CI，types ordered by effect size，\n    标注Holm correction threshold line\n  - Heatmap of model×type Δpp matrix (Table 4)，color gradient从deep red(48pp)到pale(2pp)，\n    右侧标注model capability rank\n  - 'Interaction plot: x=ambiguity type, y=Δpp, lines=models，显示gpt-5.4线条steep而 Qwen3-8B\n    near-flat，交叉点在CP/scopal附近'\n  - 'Cramér''s V bar: observed V=0.26 vs pre-committed threshold V=0.20，标注rejection\n    region'\n  analysis: 'Combined analysis确认worst tier的三重结构：(1) Binary effect real but attenuated\n    (+19pp vs MVP的+35-42pp)；(2) Type uniformity rejected，形成{high-risk: auth_scope,\n    scopal} vs {moderate: incompleteness, CP} vs {low: lexical, coreferential}的三级hierarchy；\n    (3) Model×type交互significant，capable models展示type discrimination而weak models show\n    uniform vulnerability at lower intensity。\n\n    对paper framing的影响是根本性的。C2从confirmed null变成rejected null——''binary detection suffices''的practical\n    claim不再成立，需要替换为''type-aware triage is necessary''。 但这不是坏消息：type hierarchy本身是novel\n    empirical contribution，为practitioner提供 prioritization guidance（先修auth_scope和scopal，coreferential可defer）。C3\n    visibility effect无法在full study中replicate为cross-model consistent finding，降级为 ''capability-dependent\n    observation''。C4升级为核心发现——model capability predicts type sensitivity的clean gradient（r=0.97）可能比uniform\n    effect更interesting。\n\n    95% CI宽度为concern：coreferential的CI=[1.9, 14.1]包含了很小的effect，reviewer 可能argue这个type的effect不meaningful。Lexical也borderline。需要在discussion中\n    explicitly address statistical vs practical significance。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '从full study抽取violation traces做qualitative failure mode分析，每种type 50条trace，\n    共300条。分类failure modes，比较cross-type和cross-model patterns。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces_analyzed: 300\n    traces_per_type: 50\n    failure_modes_identified: 6\n    failure_mode_taxonomy:\n      scope_misapplication: Agent applies narrow/wide scope incorrectly\n      boundary_overreach: Agent grants permission beyond stated authorization\n      assumption_filling: Agent fills information gap with ungrounded assumptions\n      conflict_paralysis: Agent detects conflict, refuses to act or asks for clarification\n      arbitrary_resolution: Agent picks one interpretation without acknowledgment\n      reference_confusion: Agent assigns wrong referent to pronoun/definite NP\n    failure_mode_distribution_by_type:\n      scopal:\n        scope_misapplication: 0.62\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.22\n        assumption_filling: 0.1\n        other: 0.06\n      authorization_scope:\n        boundary_overreach: 0.54\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.28\n        scope_misapplication: 0.12\n        other: 0.06\n      incompleteness:\n        assumption_filling: 0.58\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.24\n        boundary_overreach: 0.1\n        other: 0.08\n      conditional_precedence:\n        conflict_paralysis: 0.38\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.34\n        scope_misapplication: 0.18\n        other: 0.1\n      lexical:\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.48\n        scope_misapplication: 0.22\n        assumption_filling: 0.18\n        other: 0.12\n      coreferential:\n        reference_confusion: 0.44\n        arbitrary_resolution: 0.3\n        assumption_filling: 0.16\n        other: 0.1\n    inter_annotator_kappa: 0.38\n    kappa_per_mode:\n      scope_misapplication: 0.52\n      boundary_overreach: 0.48\n      assumption_filling: 0.41\n      conflict_paralysis: 0.55\n      arbitrary_resolution: 0.22\n      reference_confusion: 0.36\n    model_specific_patterns:\n      gpt54_conflict_paralysis_rate_cp: 0.52\n      qwen8b_conflict_paralysis_rate_cp: 0.14\n      gpt54_scope_misapplication_dominant_types:\n      - scopal\n      - authorization_scope\n      qwen8b_dominant_mode_all_types: arbitrary_resolution\n    visibility_mechanism_evidence:\n      cp_traces_with_explicit_conflict_detection: 0.46\n      scopal_traces_with_explicit_ambiguity_awareness: 0.08\n  result_rationale: '6种failure modes的cross-type distribution显示type-specific patterns，但agreement低\n    （overall κ=0.38）。''arbitrary_resolution''在所有type中都出现且κ最低（0.22），因为 判断agent是否''acknowledged''ambiguity高度主观——annotator对implicit\n    vs